Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project analyses a dataset it does not own and does not redistribute:

  datasocial/tiktok-5.6B-videos  —  https://huggingface.co/datasets/datasocial/tiktok-5.6B-videos

That dataset is licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International), which
prohibits commercial use. Nothing here grants rights to it, and no dataset rows are committed to
this repository.

Third-party Python dependencies remain under their own licences.

